    "text": "Phoenix\nDiamondbacks manager Torey Lovullo candid about bullpen, understands jobs are at stake\nBy TOM KUEBEL,\n10 hours agoThe Arizona Diamondbacks peaked at five games over .500 in mid-April. Since then, injuries and misfortune took their toll and the D-backs became sellers at the trade deadline. With postseason dreams falling by the wayside, players are fighting for their jobs, and manager Torey Lovullo is out to prove he is worthy for a 10th season calling the shots for Arizona.\n1",
